{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん聞いてくれます？泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/11/16/2913914/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸奈とせっちゃんについて何時間もかけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出とかメッセージとかその他もろもろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長文書いたのに、携帯の強制終了のせいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部消えて本気で泣きそうなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はすみません、許してください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またしっかり書きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に泣きたい。あー............＼。自分の不慮の事だったから悔しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スマホさん、頑張ってやぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中で急に仕事しなくなるんやめてぇ！泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"消えた時の私。ブルァアアアアアアア！フア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/11/16/2913914/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、正直なとこ、真顔だったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑えんかったよ、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『.......................................ぁ(._.)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じでした。はい。情けない声がうすぅーく漏れただけでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/11/16/0000.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちな、次週有吉AKB 共和国に出演します！"}],"source":"archive"}